evidence-2026-10-10","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/npatta01/trec-usersim-2026-private-evidence/zipball/paper-evidence-2026-10-10","body":"Exact available evidence for the completed TREC UserSim baseline and paper preparation.\n\n- Nine recorded organizer runs: two official and seven debug.\n- Official training export, model requests/responses, submitted messages, available receipts, frozen sources, development notes and rendered readers.\n- Two checksum-bound snapshots containing 7,408 evidence files, plus main-source commit 60382f8950a3ab2a219c07e85b32c9ed222d4a81.\n- Credentials and raw chat/session histories excluded. Missing historical receipts remain documented; this is not a new submission or a resumable migrated checkpoint.\n\nThis repository and all raw evidence must remain private. Download all four assets and follow RESTORE.md. SHA256SUMS verifies the downloaded assets; the included source verifier checks every evidence file without original machine paths. Fresh download/restore passed: all four GitHub asset digests and all 7,408 evidence-file hashes matched without original paths. Nine offline archive/index tests passed, and the restored run index/results CSV regenerate byte-for-byte. See [remote verification](https://github.com/npatta01/trec-usersim-2026-private-evidence/blob/main/remote-verification.json) and [restore report](https://github.com/npatta01/trec-usersim-2026-private-evidence/blob/main/restore-verification.json). Keep this release tag and assets unchanged; preserve future evidence in a new dated release.\n"}]